msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Oops! I get the feeling I've been going＿on a tangent. Sorry!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Uy! Siento que me fui por＿las ramas. ¡Perdón!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, you let me ask a bunch of stuff,＿so it's fine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, me dejaste preguntar un montón＿de cosas, así que está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「But you know, I get the sense that＿you're a good listener.」"
msgstr "Minori「Pero sabes, me da la impresión de＿que sabes escuchar muy bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You think so? No one's ever told me＿that before.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú crees? Nunca nadie me＿había dicho eso antes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you mean a reporter? There's no＿career in being a comedian.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No querrás decir reportero? No＿hay futuro como comediante.」"

msgid "Minori「See? Another superb response!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ves? ¡Otra respuesta magnífica!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But I'm not too good at public＿speaking. At least a journalist wouldn't＿have to deal with that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero no se me da bien hablar en público.＿Al menos un periodista no tendría＿que lidiar con eso.」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, you're right. But I knew you'd say＿something like that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, tienes razón. Pero sabía＿que dirías algo así.」"

msgid "Minori「Come on, it's time to go!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Vamos, es hora de irnos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess so. Well then, let's head off.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que sí. Bueno,＿pongámonos en marcha.」"

msgid "Minori「Aye aye, sir!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡A la orden, señor!!」"

msgid "Minori「When I talk, you're so, like, attentive or＿something that your responses are＿superb! And you're great at rebuffing」"
msgstr "Minori「Cuando hablo, eres tan atento o algo＿así que tus respuestas son magníficas.＿Y eres genial frenando」"

msgid "Minori「my jokes. You should become a＿comedian～」"
msgstr "Minori「mis bromas. Deberías hacerte comediante～」"
